+- **Deterministic:** the probe compiles the real TU with the build's recorded flags and
+  injects only the platform preprocessor state through a shadow `lmmsconfig.h` and
+  `moc -ULMMS_HAVE_ALSA`; no wall-clock timing, sleep, thread or race is involved.
+- **Cause and completeness:** the two unused functions are guarded with their only
+  caller; a scan of all other `LMMS_HAVE_ALSA` test sources found no comparable
+  unguarded helper, and the hosted log shows those targets already built.
+- **No collateral damage:** the ALSA runtime test, its assertions, the skip path and the
+  product sources are unchanged; no save format, project data, undo step, command or
+  realtime path is affected.
+- **Log destination:** the mandated log folder rejects writes in this session, so the
+  numbered logs live in the gitignored `build/qwen-logs/`; the exact commands and exit
